{"poems":[[95,"أصول الضاد طيبة الأروم","https://www.aldiwan.net/poem11416.html","الوافر"],[90,"سعروها في البحر حربا ضروسا","https://www.aldiwan.net/poem44472.html","الخفيف"],[93,"جئت لا أعلم من أين ولكني أتيت","https://www.aldiwan.net/poem8766.html","عموديه"],[87,"إلى حسين حاكم القنال","https://www.aldiwan.net/poem63688.html","الرجز"],[91,"","https://poetry.dctabudhabi.ae/diwan/poem/85412","الخفيف"],[89,"","https://poetry.dctabudhabi.ae/diwan/poem/42651","الطويل"],[95,"","https://poetry.dctabudhabi.ae/diwan/poem/54705","البسيط"],[103,"","https://poetry.dctabudhabi.ae/diwan/poem/54276","الرمل"],[92,"احمد شوقي","https://www.poetsgate.com/ViewPoem.aspx?id=179129",""],[215,"يا نجوم الفنون والدهر ليل","https://www.aldiwan.net/poem46602.html","الخفيف"],[347,"حيه ما حييت يا قلب واهدا","https://www.aldiwan.net/poem55329.html","الخفيف"],[511,"يا من حواه الدين في عصره","https://www.aldiwan.net/poem2447.html","السريع"],[543,"ترسل النكتة اللطيفة سهما","https://www.aldiwan.net/poem48158.html","عموديه"],[543,"ثلاث شهور بل ثلاث دهور","https://www.aldiwan.net/poem48177.html","عموديه"],[606,"","https://poetry.dctabudhabi.ae/diwan/poem/83303","الخفيف"],[853,"","https://poetry.dctabudhabi.ae/diwan/poem/38621","البسيط"],[961,"","https://poetry.dctabudhabi.ae/diwan/poem/100140","الطويل"],[1546,"","https://poetry.dctabudhabi.ae/diwan/poem/48936","الخفيف"],[1585,"","https://poetry.dctabudhabi.ae/diwan/poem/26670","البسيط"],[1597,"","https://poetry.dctabudhabi.ae/diwan/poem/77822","البسيط"],[230,"","https://poetry.dctabudhabi.ae/diwan/poem/125357","الخفيف"],[1923,"","https://poetry.dctabudhabi.ae/diwan/poem/118371","الطويل"],[2426,"","https://poetry.dctabudhabi.ae/diwan/poem/138832",""],[2490,"","https://poetry.dctabudhabi.ae/diwan/poem/45578","المنسرح"],[349,"","https://poetry.dctabudhabi.ae/diwan/poem/205854","الخفيف"],[349,"","https://poetry.dctabudhabi.ae/diwan/poem/205851","الخفيف"],[349,"","https://poetry.dctabudhabi.ae/diwan/poem/205436","الخفيف"],[2944,"","https://poetry.dctabudhab